    "content": "@everyone \n\nCoreFX 1.3.1 (Public Release)\n\nThanks everyone for participation in Early Access program, your feedback helped us to fix some several issues before the public release\n\n- Volumetric Clouds now have their own shadows, reflections and they render behind smoke, glass. Also we increased draw distance and improved optimization\n- Fixed issues with vehicle paint in both Legacy and Enhanced, added a new slider to enable/disable Vehpaint RGB Fix\n- Fixed issues with postfx composite shaders not working in some scenarios, we edited a lot more of them to provide better stability\n- And other minor fixes\n\nPatreon post will come in minutes with all the available download links",
